  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raising Awareness and Foster Exchange : IOM Bern&apos;s Activities in Combatting Human Trafficking to Support Fepol</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM supports the Swiss federal police (fedpol), who is donor of these activities, and other stakeholders in combatting human trafficking in Switzerland.  This will be done in three different ways:1. awareness-raising and outreach2. fostering professional exchange and3. support in crisis preparedness. IOM Bern collaborates with fedpol, the cantonal round tables to combat human trafficking and other professionals in the field and builds on previous experiences in this.</narrative>
  </description>
